window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>\"She fell through the space gate and landed on another world. He won't send her back....\"</b> </p> <p>At the frat party I see a bright light and find myself sitting on a bed with a huge monster looming over me. I'm terrified and, at the same time, there's something about those black eyes, that scent, that purrr that makes me come alive. </p> <p>Horde life is simple. When I find an Omega during a raid, I should deliver her to the compound. If I don't, I'll lose my life, the lives of my horde alphas, and I'll start a full-scale rebellion. </p> <p>And yet, I can't part from her. This one belongs to me. </p> <p>Science fiction alien captive romance with Mf Omegaverse flavor. No cliffhanger. No cheating. Barbaric unapologetic alpha male who loves hard. Let me entertain you!</p>"; 
